<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Informe Global de Agentes</title>
    <style>
        @page {
            margin: 100px 50px 80px 50px;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica', sans-serif;
            color: #2d3748;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        
        .header-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .header-logo-text {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #8e2de2;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .header-logo-sub {
            font-size: 10px;
            color: #718096;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }
        .header-meta-title {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #2d3748;
            text-align: right;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .header-meta-date {
            font-size: 9px;
            color: #a0aec0;
            text-align: right;
            margin-top: 3px;
        }
        .brand-bar {
            height: 3px;
            background-color: #8e2de2;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .section-title {
            border-left: 4px solid #8e2de2;
            padding-left: 10px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #1a202c;
            margin-top: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .zebra-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 10px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #edf2f7;
        }
        .zebra-table th {
            background-color: #8e2de2;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 9.5px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .zebra-table td {
            padding: 10px 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;
            color: #4a5568;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }
        .zebra-table tr:nth-child(even) td {
            background-color: #f7fafc;
        }

        .summary-box {
            margin-top: 35px;
            border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7;
            padding-top: 15px;
            text-align: right;
            page-break-inside: avoid;
        }
        .summary-desc {
            font-size: 10px;
            color: #a0aec0;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .footer {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: -50px;
            left: 0px;
            right: 0px;
            height: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7;
            padding-top: 8px;
        }
        .footer-left {
            float: left;
            font-size: 9px;
            color: #a0aec0;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .footer-right {
            float: right;
            font-size: 9px;
            color: #a0aec0;
        }
        .page-number:before {
            content: "Página " counter(page);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <table class="header-table">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <div class="header-logo-text">HELPDESK PRO</div>
                <div class="header-logo-sub">SISTEMA INTEGRAL DE SOPORTE TÉCNICO</div>
            </td>
            <td>
                <div class="header-meta-title">Informe Global de Agentes</div>
                <div class="header-meta-date">Mes de {{ monthName }} {{ year }}</div>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
    <div class="brand-bar"></div>

    <div class="section-title">Resumen Mensual por Agente</div>
    
    <table class="zebra-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="width: 40%;">Agente (Nombre y Apellidos)</th>
                <th style="width: 30%; text-align: right;">Horas de Conexión en App</th>
                <th style="width: 30%; text-align: right;">Horas de Trabajo (Tickets)</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for item in agentsData %}
            <tr>
                <td style="font-weight: bold;">
                    {{ item.agent.firstName }} {{ item.agent.lastName }}
                    <div style="font-size: 9px; color: #a0aec0; font-weight: normal;">{{ item.agent.email }}</div>
                </td>
                <td style="text-align: right; font-weight: bold;">
                    {% if item.totalMinutes > 0 %}
                        {{ (item.totalMinutes / 60)|number_format(1) }} h
                    {% else %}
                        <span style="color: #a0aec0; font-weight: normal;">-</span>
                    {% endif %}
                </td>
                <td style="text-align: right; font-weight: bold; color: #2e7d32;">
                    {% if item.workMinutes > 0 %}
                        {{ (item.workMinutes / 60)|number_format(1) }} h
                    {% else %}
                        <span style="color: #a0aec0; font-weight: normal;">-</span>
                    {% endif %}
                </td>
            </tr>
            {% else %}
            <tr>
                <td colspan="3" style="text-align: center; color: #a0aec0; font-style: italic; padding: 25px;">
                    No hay agentes registrados en el sistema.
                </td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="summary-box">
        <div class="summary-desc">
            * Este informe certifica las horas acumuladas de sesión y trabajo de todos los agentes de la plataforma HelpDesk Pro para el periodo indicado.<br>
            Generado para fines de auditoría interna el {{ "now"|date("d/m/Y H:i") }}
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <span class="footer-left">REGISTRO DE CONTROL MENSUAL - HELPDESK PRO</span>
        <span class="footer-right page-number"></span>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
